{
  "id": "1161",
  "title": "Don’t Worry",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-01-16",
  "synopsis": "Don’t worry, there may be an easier and cheaper alternative to seeing the doctor.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1161/d765944f962c6782d211b81f1fa103bacf5ad4b8.mp3?1608994268",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "不用担心\n\n    有一位妻子，她每天都很担心，担心床下面有坏人。所以每天睡觉后，她都要起床看一看。\n    她去看医生。医生想了一个好办法，对她说：“你的病我有办法，但是要看十次。你一个星期来一次，每次900元。”\n    妻子觉得太贵了。回家后，她告诉丈夫医生的话。丈夫没说什么，马上锯掉了四个床腿。",
    "traditional": "不用擔心\n\n    有一位妻子，她每天都很擔心，擔心床下面有壞人。所以每天睡覺後，她都要起床看一看。\n    她去看醫生。醫生想了一個好辦法，對她說：“你的病我有辦法，但是要看十次。你一個星期來一次，每次900元。”\n    妻子覺得太貴了。回家後，她告訴丈夫醫生的話。丈夫沒說什麼，馬上鋸掉了四個床腿。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Don’t Worry"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "有一位妻子，她每天都很担心，担心床下面有坏人。",
      "traditional": "有一位妻子，她每天都很擔心，擔心床下面有壞人。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yí wèi qī zi tā měi tiān dōu hěn dān xīn dān xīn chuáng xià miàn yǒu huài rén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "所以每天睡觉后，她都要起床看一看。",
      "traditional": "所以每天睡覺後，她都要起床看一看。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ měi tiān shuì jiào hòu tā dōu yào qǐ chuáng kàn yí kàn",
      "english": "There was a wife who was very worried every day, worried that there was a bad person under her bed."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So, every day after going to bed, she had to get up to have a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "她去看医生。医生想了一个好办法，对她说：",
      "traditional": "她去看醫生。醫生想了一個好辦法，對她說：",
      "pinyin": "tā qù kàn yī shēng yī shēng xiǎng le yí ge hǎo bàn fǎ duì tā shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“你的病我有办法，但是要看十次。你一个星期来一次，每次900元。”",
      "traditional": "“你的病我有辦法，但是要看十次。你一個星期來一次，每次900元。”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ de bìng wǒ yǒu bàn fǎ dàn shì yào kàn shí cì nǐ yí ge xīng qī lái yí cì měi cì 2 yuán",
      "english": "She went to see the doctor. The doctor thought of a good method, and said to her, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. “I have a treatment for your sickness, but you must come ten times. Come once a week, each time will be 900 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妻子觉得太贵了。回家后，她告诉丈夫医生的话。",
      "traditional": "妻子覺得太貴了。回家後，她告訴丈夫醫生的話。",
      "pinyin": "qī zi jué de tài guì le huí jiā hòu tā gào su zhàng fu yī shēng de huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "丈夫没说什么，马上锯掉了四个床腿。",
      "traditional": "丈夫沒說什麼，馬上鋸掉了四個床腿。",
      "pinyin": "zhàng fu méi shuō shén me mǎ shàng jù diào le sì ge chuáng tuǐ",
      "english": "The wife thought that it was too expensive. After she returned home, she told her husband what the doctor had said."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The husband didn’t say anything, and immediately sawed off the four bed legs."
    }
  ],
