      "",
      "There was a wife who was very worried every day, worried that there was a bad person under her bed.",
      "So, every day after going to bed, she had to get up to have a look.",
      "",
      "She went to see the doctor. The doctor thought of a good method, and said to her, ..",
      ".. “I have a treatment for your sickness, but you must come ten times. Come once a week, each time will be 900 yuan.",
      "",
